BEGIN:VEVENTUID:19970901T130000Z-1234051@boring.partySUMMARY:TaskmasterDTSTAMP:20261001T190000DESCRIPTION:Isy Suttie unexpectedly mentions eggs, Matt Lucas stares hard at the ceiling, Nina Conti gets very clever in a test, Chloe Petts hides an object somewhere Alex Horne wouldn't dare look, and Richard Ayoade gives the slight impression that he finds some of the tasks a bit irritating. But why is Greg Davies wearing a white glove?DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261001T140000DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261001T150000END:VEVENT
